<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1404_4969.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruindtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dienßt</unclear> sampt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> ehren liebs,
<lb n="2"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuevor</unclear>. From <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fursichtig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erßam</unclear> Wyß,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inßonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruind</unclear> und gethruiw lieb Eydtgnosßen, Alß.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> schikung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gotes</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßr</unclear> sonder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hertzig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khrißtenlichen</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yffer</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitlandtluit</unclear>. der <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-771" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Evangelischen Rellion.</orgName> in
<lb n="6"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-295" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lintthall</placeName>. ein nuwe kihlchen erbuwen, unnd sallichen buw,
<lb n="7"/>zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vollfuoerren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woll</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irrem</unclear> vermuegen gsin, uff.
<lb n="8"/>sy biderben luit. wie gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bschechen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hilff</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stuir</unclear>,
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeruoefft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">piten</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dernen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">g</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">l</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>.
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gfallen</unclear> hat, gedacht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtluit</unclear>, an sollichen buw,
<lb n="11"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zweyhundert</unclear> silber kronen ouch zu erhaltung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eineß</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">predicanten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoverhren</unclear>, Wellich goelt die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verordneten</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/>der gmeind <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lintthall</unclear>. von dem Edlen veßten Junkher.
<lb n="14"/><persName resp="#ner">Caspar Schlumpf</persName> uwerem ehren mit rath <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entpffangen</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">da</unclear> sollich goelt dhkeinn andren gstalt. dan an sollichen buw,
<lb n="16"/>und zu erhaltung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eineß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">predicanten</unclear> soll <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwendt</unclear> und,
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anglegt</unclear> werden. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Harumb</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uich</unclear>. wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonderlich</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtluit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-295" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lintthall</unclear></placeName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruindtlich</unclear>. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydgnoeßisch</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thund</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thanckhen</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbiutung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wo</unclear> wir. solliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schencki</unclear>,
<lb n="20"/>und gab. umb uich khuenend bschulden und verdienen, wollen,
<lb n="21"/>wir unß willig erfinden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, Wie ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantze</unclear> gemeind
<lb n="22"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-295" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lintthall</unclear></placeName>. der Evangelischen Rellion, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbiutens</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> allmecht-
<lb n="23"/>igen got <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">piten</unclear>. daß er sollicher bewijßnen guet that. uich
<lb n="24"/>belonen wolle uich hargegen alle fruindtschafft Eydgnoeßische
<lb n="25"/>thriuw und liebe zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzeigen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sind</unclear> wir wollgeneigt und,
<lb n="26"/>guetwillig. Thund uich hiemit in den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gotes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woll</unclear>,
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befelchen</unclear> dat. <origDate when="1601-12-10" resp="#ner">den 10 t decembri a° 1601</origDate>.
<lb n="28"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Landtamman und Rath</orgName>
<lb n="29"/>zuo <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-73" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Glaruß</origPlace>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1404_4970.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1404_4971.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1404_4972.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="30"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear> fürsichtigen ersamen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear>,
<lb n="31"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rath, der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> Sant
<lb n="32"/>Gallen</orgName>, unseren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insunders</unclear> gueten fründen,
<lb n="33"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eidtgnossen</unclear>.
</p>
